c","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":42823680,"digest":"sha256:815bcb61ca779b8112b0c14e2f2827466d81529583dd26fa2f3021c4c56e97ce","download_count":49,"created_at":"2026-10-25T20:52:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T20:52:05Z"},{"id":676132269,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4oTPWt","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":47812538,"digest":"sha256:ef2d378a368a43b0d6c5f5bfb7906bdea2b9b73ebe1c87a4c8b60d74a7969127","download_count":78,"created_at":"2026-10-25T21:09:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T21:09:13Z"},{"id":676151029,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4oTT71","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":16673,"digest":"sha256:88cfd320cc62eb1b750156c0786c91352756269f816e28567d5097be68feec7d","download_count":7702,"created_at":"2026-10-25T21:18:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T21:18:32Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- Oracle、OceanBase Oracle 与达梦支持触发器管理和原生日志作业管理，含新建、替换、启停、编译与 SQL 预览 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#13403](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13403))\n- Oracle 执行失败时自动定位到出错位置并标记完整限定对象，保留结果区按钮可再次定位 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#13420](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13420))\n- 侧边栏把包体拆成独立分组，查看和编辑包体不再误开包规格 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13422](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13422))\n- 结构比较新增忽略 schema 名差异，`public.users` 与 `analytics.users` 视为相同，并可切回原始对照 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#13421](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13421))\n- 查询结果支持右键按单元格值筛选，在已加载结果内按相等、包含、空值等条件过滤 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13419](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13419))\n- 手动数据导出支持排队执行，等待进行中的导出结束后按顺序写出 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#13441](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13441))\n- 导入数据时可为列选择自动生成 UUID、当前时间、当前日期或自增序号 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#13408](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13408))\n- MySQL 与 PostgreSQL 的导入数据对话框支持直接恢复 Navicat .nb3 备份 (contributed by @alanslengkoan) (PR [#13427](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13427))\n- 支持导入 RedisDesktopManager 连接配置，含嵌套分组、ACL、TLS 证书与 SSH 隧道 (contributed by @CSXFanMeng) (PR [#13424](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13424))\n- 定时数据库备份支持 openGauss (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#13431](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13431))\n- 新增设置项，打开表时直接使用独立窗口，便于并排对比多个表 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13347](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13347))\n- 离线驱动包导出可关闭 JRE 运行时，包体积显著减小 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13395](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13395))\n- 新增设置项，可选择显示查询连接的完整分组路径 (contributed by @hanxuanyu) (PR [#13282](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13282))\n- SQL 文件库与 SQL 文件面板各自记住搜索范围，并在文件库中新增定位当前文件按钮 (contributed by @heeeex100) (PR [#13416](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13416))\n\n### 改进\n\n- 编辑器连接信息在长分组路径下可收缩截断，展开下拉时不再弹出重叠的详情浮层 (contributed by @hanxuanyu) (PR [#13282](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13282))\n- 长 SQL 字符串触发自动补全时不再卡顿，标识符匹配改为从末尾逆向扫描 (contributed by @Acd-kk) (PR [#13430](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13430))\n- Databricks JDBC 驱动更新到 3.4.4 (contributed by @renovate[bot]) (PR [#13434](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13434))\n- Gson 升级到 2.15.0 (contributed by @renovate[bot]) (PR [#13440](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13440))\n\n### 修复\n\n- 修复切换结果标签重新挂载数据表格时，未提交的编辑丢失的问题\n- 修复结果集很大时超出浏览器布局上限的行无法滚动到的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#13415](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13415))\n- 修复 DuckDB 导出按非唯一列排序时出现重复或漏行、金额汇总不一致的问题 (contributed by @Acd-kk) (PR [#13423](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13423))\n- 修复 SQL Server 顶层 `BEGIN ... END` 与 TRY/CATCH 块被拆分执行、`BEGIN TRANSACTION` 报语法错误的问题 (contributed by @caiyq925-cell) (PR [#13439](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13439))\n- 修复 TDengine 大库表列表加载缓慢且只显示少数表的问题 (contributed by @HighBigSky) (PR [#13425](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13425))\n- 修复人大金仓表无法编辑、无法新增数据的问题，主键在 V9 下可正确识别 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#13414](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13414))\n- 修复 Oracle 数据迁移对象列表缺少触发器的问题 (contributed by @Acd-kk) (PR [#13409](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13409))\n- 修复 GBase 8s 表结构编辑时列默认值不显示的问题 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13344](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13344))\n- 修复 OceanBase Oracle 模式表列表缺少行数与容量统计的问题 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#13402](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13402))\n- 修复 OceanBase 连接切换兼容模式时自定义端口被重置的问题 (contributed by @efeire) (PR [#13401](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13401))\n- 修复 Kafka 消费组较多时总览缺少成员、位点与积压信息的问题 (contributed by @lcq928) (PR [#13410](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13410))\n- 修复旧版 MongoDB 服务端只支持静态 RSA 密钥交换时无法建立 TLS 连接的问题 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#13413](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13413))\n- 修复空间几何与 WKT 文本单元格无法按选区预览图层的问题 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#13406](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13406))\n- 修复结果集页签提示在解析不出源表时展示整条 SQL、遮挡页签条的问题 (contributed by @caiyq925-cell) (PR [#13407](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13407))\n- 修复 MCP 替换临时文件带只读属性时无法清理、每次启动重复失败的问题 (contributed by @caiyq925-cell) (PR [#13437](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13437))\n- 修复 macOS 上主窗口位置与尺寸在多显示器、缩放比例不同时恢复错位的问题\n- 修复更新准备阶段点击重启和写入草稿被拦截的问题\n- 修复 macOS 26/27 上长选区被意外取消的问题\n- 修复 SQL 编辑器中悬停元数据显示了未限定数据库的同名表信息的问题\n- 修复表结构与信息区域无法显示列注释的问题\n- 修复官网插件页在同名插件下 SEO 标题重复的问题\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.55) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.55` 拉取。\n","reactions":{"total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"mentions_count":13}
